00122Er 2               ; Snapshot kind/type/scope/offset/pcount onto the 6502 stack —
00122Er 2               ; sym_save_* would conflict with parse_assign_or_call when this
00122Er 2               ; @ident_or_call runs inside a nested parse_expression.
00122Er 2  A0 16                LDY     #22
001230r 2  B1 rr                LDA     (tmp3),y
