001533r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
001536r 2  68                   PLA
001537r 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
00153Ar 2  A5 rr                LDA     scratch
00153Cr 2  20 rr rr             JSR     emit_byte
